Use the **prescription-review** skill — an evidence-gated review protocol, not memory-based opinion.

## Verdict (exactly one)

```
PASS | FLAG | INSUFFICIENT_DATA | REQUIRES_PHARMACIST_REVIEW
```

## Hard gates

- 缺关键患者信息（年龄/体重/肝肾功能/妊娠哺乳/过敏史/诊断）→ 不得 PASS
- 无实时版本化药品证据（说明书/来源/版本/日期）→ 不得"安全性确定"
- 相互作用未实际查询 → 不得输出"未发现相互作用"

## Notes

- Verdict is exactly one of the four; no vague "可能合理"
- Prescription review is the pharmacist's legal duty; this skill is an assistive gate protocol
